TidyTV Care phone-only update:
  Phone dashboard, explicit cache-maintenance action, in-app 15-day reminder and
  phone-side JAKIM prayer card. Cache strategy follows Glass TV's pm trim-caches
  approach, executed through TidyTV's existing TV shell only after confirmation
  and a verified configuration backup. No Glass TV self-scheduling ADB daemon
  is installed on the TV by these features. Data source: JAKIM e-Solat.

